      "sourceText": "另外，开启先验后，代码会延后新点插入；相关有效处理计数超过200后，仍会继续更新地图。因此这个开关也不意味着地图永久冻结。",
      "translatedText": "In addition, after enabling the prior, the code delays the insertion of new points; after the relevant valid processing count exceeds 200, it will still continue to update the map\\. Therefore, this switch does not mean that the map is permanently frozen either\\.",
